title = "Tioga Road"
text = "Highway 120 east: 39 miles across the high country to Tuolumne Meadows, then over Tioga Pass at nearly 10,000 feet. Snow closes it from about November until late May or June. The Tuolumne Grove of giant sequoias is just up the road."

